    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Lead Follow-up Engine\n\nRuns every hour. Finds leads due for a follow-up, checks whether they replied, sends the next message and updates the sheet.\n\n- **Sequence:** 3 follow-ups (Day 1, 3, 7), then the lead is Closed\n- **Replies:** detected in the inbox, the sequence stops\n- **Messages:** edited in the Templates tab\n- **Safety:** sheet is updated right after sending, so no lead is emailed twice\n- **Errors:** Global Error Handler workflow alerts the owner",
        "height": 640,
        "width": 2288,
        "color": 6
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
